DLC_Dat["Flames of Ambition"]={}
DLC_Dat["Flames of Ambition"].name="Flames of Ambition"
DLC_Dat["Flames of Ambition"].dat={
2831, -- Black Drake Villa Vanquisher,  Defeat Kinras Ironeye, Captain Geminus, and Pyroturge Encratis in Black Drake Villa.
2832, -- Black Drake Villa Conqueror,  Defeat Kinras Ironeye, Captain Geminus, and Pyroturge Encratis in Veteran Black Drake Villa.
2833, -- Snuffed Out,  Defeat Pyroturge Encratis after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Black Drake Villa.
2834, -- Speed Reader,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Kinras Ironeye, Captain Geminus, and Pyroturge Encratis within 25 minutes of entering Veteran Black Drake Villa. Your timer starts when you engage the first group of enemies.
2835, -- Unsinged,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Kinras Ironeye, Captain Geminus, and Pyroturge Encratis in Veteran Black Drake Villa without suffering a group member death.
2837, -- Black Drake Villa Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Black Drake Villa.
2838, -- Ardent Bibliophile,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Kinras Ironeye, Captain Geminus, and Pyroturge Encratis after raising the challenge banner for each in Veteran Black Drake Villa within 25 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts upon engaging the first group of enemies.
2841, -- The Cauldron Vanquisher,  Defeat Oxblood the Depraved, Taskmaster Viccia, the Molten Guardian; free Lyranth; and defeat Baron Zaudrus in the Cauldron.
2842, -- The Cauldron Conqueror,  Defeat Oxblood the Depraved, Taskmaster Viccia, the Molten Guardian; free Lyranth; and defeat Baron Zaudrus in Veteran Cauldron.
2843, -- Schemes Disrupted,  Defeat Baron Zaudrus after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Cauldron.
2844, -- Hot-Footed,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Oxblood the Depraved, Taskmaster Viccia, the Molten Guardian; free Lyranth; and defeat Baron Zaudrus within 35 minutes of entering Veteran Cauldron. Your timer starts when you engage the first group of enemies.
2845, -- Relentless Justice,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Oxblood the Depraved, Taskmaster Viccia, the Molten Guardian; free Lyranth; and defeat Baron Zaudrus in Veteran Cauldron without suffering a group member death.
2846, -- The Cauldron Challenger,  Complete the listed achievements for Veteran Cauldron.
2847, -- Subterranean Smasher,  Defeat all encounters in addition to Oxblood the Depraved, Taskmaster Viccia, the Molten Guardian; free Lyranth; and defeat Baron Zaudrus after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Cauldron within 35 minutes without suffering a group member death. Your timer starts upon engaging the first group of enemies.
2848, -- Flames of Ambition Delver,  Complete both Black Drake Villa and the Cauldron in Veteran.
2864, -- Flames of Ambition Scout,  Complete both Black Drake Villa and the Cauldron in Normal.
2879, -- Eviction Notice,  Defeat Kinras Ironeye after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Black Drake Villa.
2880, -- Breaking Ranks,  Defeat Captain Geminus after raising the challenge banner in Veteran Black Drake Villa.
2881, -- Amphibians Arrested,  Defeat Kinras Ironeye before any Blazing Salamanders can cast Fiery Favor onto him in Black Drake VIlla.
2882, -- Shake It Up,  Defeat Captain Geminus without any group member being struck by a Seismic Tremor during the fight in Veteran Black Drake Villa.
2883, -- Salley-oop,  Defeat Pyroturge Encratis after killing at least ten Grotto Salamanders during the fight in Veteran Black Drake Villa.
2884, -- Bullseye!,  Use a geyser to launch yourself into the eye of Pyroturge Encratis's Firestorm 5 times in Black Drake Villa.
2885, -- Glob Security,  Defeat Oxblood the Depraved without killing any of the Gore Globs during the fight in Veteran Cauldron. Oxblood must not use Deviant Consumption to consume one of the Gore Globs.
2886, -- Can't Catch Me!,  Defeat Taskmaster Viccia without anyone in your group triggering a single trap in Veteran Cauldron.
2887, -- Curtain of Fire,  During the fight against the Molten Guardian, allow 20 ticks of Magmatic Eruption to fire consecutively without interruption in Veteran Cauldron.
2888, -- Master of Messes,  Free Lyranth after using three or less Daedric Catalyst Fluids in Veteran Cauldron.
2890, -- Hold It Together,  Defeat Baron Zaudrus without suffering a group member death via Ash Vent Disintegration in Veteran Cauldron.
}
